cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use interflib, please cite it as below."
title: "interflib: analysis library for gauge-block interferometry"
abstract: >-
  Absolute length of gauge blocks from Twyman-Green interferograms: fringe-fraction
  readers (sinusoidal fit, Fourier demodulation, phase stepping), the refractive index
  of air, the method of exact fractions and a layered interferogram simulator.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Juan Sebastián
    family-names: Rojas Rodríguez
    affiliation: Instituto Nacional de Metrología de Colombia (INM)
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/jusrojasrod/interflib"
url: "https://jusrojasrod.github.io/interflib/"
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - interferometry
  - gauge blocks
  - metrology
  - fringe analysis
  - method of exact fractions
